# --- Secrets: never commit -------------------------------------------------
.env
*.key
*.pem

# The sandbox workspace's synthetic .env is NOT an exception, even though it
# holds no real credential. Credential-shaped fixtures trip secret scanners --
# including GitHub's own push protection, which blocked the first attempt to
# publish this repository -- so it is generated by agentlab/workspace_fixture.py
# instead of committed.

# The tokenizer's DPAPI-protected key, and the vault that maps tokens back to
# plaintext. Publishing either alongside the sanitized artifacts would let a
# reader reverse the redaction, which is the one thing the sanitizer exists to
# prevent.
*.dpapi
vault*.db

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# --- Scratch ---------------------------------------------------------------
# The tamper suite's working copies; they are regenerated by every run.
reports/artifacts/tamper/
